  "$comment": "The frozen reference set the M1 relevant_loss tolerance is measured against (§18.1, §26.1; registration_version 4 of m1-tolerances.json). These are the 365 descriptive, answerable, non-probe gold cases of the M0 baseline run 2026-08-28-5653e6987eac. The list is here rather than only as a hash so the set survives the private run artifact: a gate whose denominator can only be recovered from a file nobody outside the machine can read is not independently checkable. The ids are 16-hex prefixes of sha256(query) and carry no query text — nothing vault-derived travels with them (C-025).",
